ttps://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307928.jpg"},{"title":"A Weary New Moon`s Night","synopsis":"Toshihiko escaped with Yuka and they hide themselves in a far away mansion.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307929.jpg"},{"title":"The Pain of the Past","synopsis":"The story of Toshiko's father is finally revealed, as how he became the leader of the Kifūken and his relationship with Yuka's mother.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307930.jpg"},{"title":"A Woman`s Hidden Taste","synopsis":"Kyūtarō exposes his plan to reformulate the Kifūken's organization with the help of Kazuma. Trouble arises when another member of the school gets himself involved with a Shokujinki.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307931.jpg"},{"title":"Harsh Birthday","synopsis":"Yuka celebrates her birthday with Toshihiko, but when she tried one of his secret immobilization techniques on him, he ends up paralyzed, just when their gigantic pursuer finds them.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307932.jpg"},{"title":"The Sweet Smell of Rie","synopsis":"Rie discovers Toshihiko's hideout and goes all out trying to bring him back home. Meanwhile, Yuka has a surprising revelation.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307934.jpg"},{"title":"Confinement Has the Taste of Iron","synopsis":"Toshihiko is captured and tortured by a group of Shokujinki commanded by Yuka's former lover. But soon the Kifūken discovers their location and storm the place.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307935.jpg"},{"title":"Sweet Dreams","synopsis":"Once again on the run, Toshihiko and Yuka take a hike with a kind old couple. While traveling with them, they try to sort out their feelings for each other.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307936.jpg"},{"title":"People`s Unhappiness Has the Taste of Mercy","synopsis":"As Kyūtarō Ōba put his master plan in motion, he finally reveals his true colors.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307938.jpg"},{"title":"The Rain Is Bitter","synopsis":"Ōba transforms Rie in a Shokujinki and put her into a fight against Yuka. Meanwhile, Kazuma discovers the truth about his origin.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307940.jpg"},{"title":"Coffee Flavored Kibidango","synopsis":"While Toshihiko tries to convince Rie's father to join his battle against Ōba, Kazuma rushes to fight him by himself.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/307943.jpg"},{"title":"No Connection to Taste","synopsis":"Toshihiko and his allies struggle to stop Ōba's ambitions.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79410/324188.jpg"}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
